  "beta_arms_note": "Verification budget multipliers, per PREREG. Not temperatures. Enter F as the coefficient on the entropic term.",
  "single_doc_tolerance": 1e-09,
  "single_doc_tolerance_note": "Null cell (iv) compares the observed floor against the CONSENSUS floor — the same ledger with every block forced to its modal value, so it cannot disagree with itself. This is the numerical floor beneath that comparison. The earlier bootstrap band was vacuous: centred on the observed floors, it passed at any floor.",
  "duplicate_residue_tolerance": 1e-12,
  "duplicate_residue_tolerance_note": "Null cell (v): 'zero cold residue' means zero. The engine is deterministic and a genuine duplicate yields bit-identical evidence, so only float-ordering noise is admissible. Comparing against a bootstrap band of the observed floors made the cell vacuous and was caught by its positive control.",
  "rewire_passes": 10,
  "rewire_note": "Double-edge-swap passes per edge in the R4 null rewire (PREREG-AMENDMENT-2). 10 passes is well past the mixing point for graphs this size; swaps that would create a self-loop or duplicate are refused, so degree and weight marginals hold exactly.",
  "studentize_min_scale": 1e-12,
  "studentize_note": "Below this null MAD a loop's permutation scale is treated as degenerate and that loop falls back to raw leave-one-out pooling (PREREG-AMENDMENT-3 studentization repair). Reported per loop.",
  "loop_constructor": {
    "min_cycle_length": 3,
    "require_closure_in_q": true,
    "allow_immediate_backtracking": false,
    "prefer_chart_alternating_order": true,
    "open_walk_policy": "raise",
    "backtrack_policy": "measured-shadow-channel"
  },
  "loop_constructor_note": "The loop-constructor spec, seeded because it decides what the meter measures. Holonomy is defined only on verified cycles: closed, every edge present in Q, no immediate backtracking, length >= 3. A backtrack walk u->v->u is not a loop; its closure defect is measured per edge and compared against the declared shadow. An open walk raises rather than being silently measured. Tree-null repair, 2026-07-30.",
  "charts_note": "Chart set moved to seed/CHARTS.json (item-2 plug-in refactor); that manifest is authoritative. Formerly listed here as english/lean."
